mailio
------------------------------------------
mailio is a cross platform C++ library for MIME format and SMTP, POP3 and IMAP
protocols. It is based on the standard C++ 17 and Boost library.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.11-1
  libboost_regex1.66-1.66.0-1
  libboost_system1.66-1.66.0-1
  libgcc1-14.4.0-1
  libmailio-devel-0.26.1-1bl1
  libmailio2-0.26.1-1bl1
  libssl3-3.5.9-1
  libstdc++6-14.4.0-1
  pkg-config-3.0.9-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  binutils-2.47-1
  cmake-4.4.4-1
  cygport-0.37.10-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  gcc-g++-14.4.0-1
  libboost-devel-1.66.0-1
  libssl-devel-3.5.9-1
  ninja-1.13.2-1

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/karastojko/mailio

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/karastojko/mailio/archive/refs/tags/0.26.1.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack mailio-0.26.1-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./mailio-0.26.1-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/mailio-0.26.1-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/mailio-0.26.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libmailio2-0.26.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libmailio-devel-0.26.1-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

